mes and prefer the lottery where that outcome is better. So A: min prob outcome = -4000 at 20%; B: min prob outcome = -3000 at 25%. Comparing -4000 vs -3000, -3000 is more favorable. So the reason would prefer B. Thus, the reason is applicable and would lead to choosing B.",
